{
  "version": "1",
  "text": "For your evening vocal lesson at the office, you are dressed in a soft and effortless style. Your outfit features a loose grey linen shirt from Bristol worn over the shoulder to give a more relaxed vibe, paired with wide-legged black trousers that let you move freely while still looking put-together. The beige sleeveless chambray dress is layered underneath for extra warmth during those cooler evening hours, its ruffled hemline adding a touch of romance that contrasts beautifully with your tailored beige blazer from Emily worn open to reveal the mix. A small beige wallet on a chain hangs from your waist, providing both security and style. The warm brown suede ankle boots by Attico complete your ensemble, offering maximum comfort for walking around campus while looking chic enough for work.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Let your blazer hang open to show the layered looks underneath—the soft beige dress adds romance, while the grey shirt keeps it grounded in casual chic.",
    "Roll up or tie back your sleeves on the linen shirt so you can move freely during vocal practice without feeling restricted."
  ],
  "wrong_photos": [
    "#67·35",
    "#321·35",
    "#61·39",
    "#49·03"
  ],
  "about_items": [
    {
      "n": "#67·35",
      "text": "This grey linen shirt from Bristol has a relaxed, unstructured silhouette with soft shoulders and subtle pockets at the chest. Its loose fit allows for effortless movement, making it perfect for an evening when comfort is key."
    },
    {
      "n": "#321·35",
      "text": "This beige sleeveless chambray dress by Chambray features delicate ruffles along the hemline that add a romantic touch to your look. The fabric flows gently, creating a fluid drape that enhances your natural grace."
    },
    {
      "n": "#61·39",
      "text": "The beige blazer from Emily is lightweight and tailored without padding, offering a modern yet understated elegance. Its clean lines provide structure to balance the softer layers beneath while maintaining a relaxed feel."
    },
    {
      "n": "#380·03",
      "text": "This small beige wallet by Attico is compact enough to hang from your waist, providing easy access to essentials without adding bulk. Its minimalist design complements the neutral tones of your outfit perfectly."
    },
    {
      "n": "#49·03",
      "text": "These dark brown suede ankle boots from Attico feature a cozy shearling lining and a sturdy sole, ensuring comfort throughout your day. Their sleek design matches seamlessly with the rest of your ensemble, blending utility with style."
    }
  ]
}
